  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, an assassin gains a technique pool, representing his ability to execute \"cold\" techniques. The number of points in an assassin's technique pool is equal to his assassin level + his Intelligence modifier. Technique points are used to pay the costs of techniques that are Pool Compatible, as detailed in assassin techniques, above.</p>\n<p>The technique pool is replenished each morning after 8 hours of rest or meditation; these hours do not need to be consecutive.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-assassin#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
